.DS_Store

# Agent/tool scratch output — not project artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
.qwen/

# Cursor mirrored plan copies — plans/ is the single source of truth
.cursor/plans/

# Pages staging dir (built by .github/workflows/pages.yml, never committed)
_site/

# Design exploration sandbox — LOCAL ONLY by default. Unreviewed visual/interaction
# explorations live here and must not be client-facing. Ignored so they can
# never reach the public repo (raw.githubusercontent.com) or the Pages
# allowlist. See 03_Design/explorations/README.md for the rules + promotion path.
# Exception: 02-video-hero/ and homev2/ are tracked for internal GH Pages previews
# (HTML + direction.md; hero media staged from 02-video-hero/assets at deploy).
# Square reference media stays ignored — copyrighted, unlicensed; see
# inspiration.md §2.2 and 03_Design/assets/reference/.
03_Design/explorations/*
!03_Design/explorations/README.md
!03_Design/explorations/02-video-hero/
!03_Design/explorations/02-video-hero/index.html
!03_Design/explorations/02-video-hero/direction.md
!03_Design/explorations/homev2/
!03_Design/explorations/homev2/index.html
!03_Design/explorations/homev2/direction.md
03_Design/explorations/homev2/assets/*
# assets/ is an ALLOW-list, not a deny-list: everything in it is ignored except
# the two files that must ship. This fails CLOSED — a Square reference clip (or
# any other media) dropped in here under a name not listed below stays out of the
# public repo, instead of being committed because nobody remembered to deny it.
# Only widen this for a genuinely licensed asset, and record its licence here.
# hero-stock.mp4 = Mixkit free licence. Square clips are unlicensed — never add.
03_Design/explorations/02-video-hero/assets/*
!03_Design/explorations/02-video-hero/assets/fullsteam-logo.svg
!03_Design/explorations/02-video-hero/assets/hero-stock.mp4



# Confidential client source docs — do NOT commit to this public repo
# This repo is PUBLIC. Since 2026-09-25 Pages publishes an explicit allowlist
# (index.html + 02_Wireframes/, staged in the workflow) rather than the repo root,
# so a tracked file is no longer automatically downloadable from
# mattybotstew.github.io. It IS still readable on raw.githubusercontent.com, so
# ignoring is still the control that matters. See PROJECT_KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md §22.7.
clientDocs/
# Individual entries kept for history (the blanket rule above covers them):
clientDocs/Fullsteam Overview_Confidential - redacted.pdf
clientDocs/Fullsteam User Interview Template.xlsx
clientDocs/Fullsteam Strategic Messaging Architecture V2.docx

# Third-party reference media — LOCAL ONLY, never commit.
# Pulled from reference sites (e.g. the Square hero video) for layout study only.
# This repo is PUBLIC and raw.githubusercontent.com serves any tracked file, so
# someone else's copyrighted video must not be committed here. Reference media is
# for internal study; it is not licensed for reuse in the Fullsteam build.
# See inspiration.md §2.2 for the source URL of each pull.
03_Design/assets/reference/

# HISTORY NOTE: the 5 clientDocs files that were committed before these rules existed
# (Fullsteam Kickoff Presentation.pdf, Fullsteam Web Brief (1).docx, Fullsteam Website
# Content Project Brief.docx + "copy", Fullsteam Color Palette Cheat sheet.pdf) have been
# untracked from HEAD and purged from git history. See PROJECT_KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md §22.7.
